1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,927
B, longitudinal.

2
00:00:01,927 --> 00:00:08,151
Air has no stiffness against sideways shearing, so it cannot pass on a transverse vibration.

3
00:00:08,151 --> 00:00:15,807
The air molecules can only push on their neighbours along the direction of travel, making compressions and rarefactions.

